      "text": "A relevant and quite similar benchmark by @anders_murphy, that demonstrates the same principle in our keynote. In this case, SQLite achieves 40k TPS without batching, and without a webserver/ORM backend.\n\nEliminating network latency between server and database is essential. https://t.co/uDKt91gMZu",
