      "created_at": "2026-02-27T21:44:47+00:00",
      "text": "This is a dangerous and fundamental misunderstanding of how SpacetimeDB works. By default, SpacetimeDB waits for all data to be durably persisted to disk BEFORE exposing it to clients.\n\nWe have a deeper dive coming, but dataloss is the cardinal sin of databases, and so we need to https://t.co/frnnRoXyn0",
