      "created_at": "2026-02-27T20:29:11+00:00",
      "text": "This is a dangerous and fundamental misunderstanding of how SpacetimeDB works. By default, SpacetimeDB waits for all data to be durably persisted to disk BEFORE exposing it to clients.\n\nThe window in which you can lose data not \"very small\", it's absolutely 0.\n\nSpacetimeDB can be https://t.co/i6yJQQyacO",
